{"seq":1,"slug":"pushdown-automata","title":"下推自动机与状态栈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/advanced/pushdown-automata","wordCount":630,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"下推自动机与状态栈\">下推自动机与状态栈</h1><p>下推自动机（Pushdown Automaton，PDA）是有限状态机的一个扩展，通过引入<strong>栈结构</strong>，赋予了状态机「记忆」和「返回」的能力。在游戏开发中，下推自动机最直观的应用是<strong>状态栈（State Stack）</strong>——将状态像操作系统的函数调用栈一样管理，支持暂停当前状态、进入新状态、然后弹回原状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>普通 FSM 的状态切换是「替换」：从 A 切换到 B 后，A 的上下文完全丢失。下推自动机的状态切换是「入栈/出栈」：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Push（入栈）</strong>：暂停当前状态（不执行 OnExit），将新状态压入栈顶并执行 OnEnter</li>\n<li><strong>Pop（出栈）</strong>：结束当前状态（执行 OnExit），移除栈顶，恢复下一个状态（不重新执行 OnEnter）</li>\n<li><strong>栈顶状态</strong>：当前活跃的状态，只有它接受 Update tick</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    state &quot;状态栈(时间顺序)&quot; as stack {&#10;        state &quot;t0: [InGame]&quot; as t0&#10;        state &quot;t1: [InGame, PauseMenu]&quot; as t1&#10;        state &quot;t2: [InGame, PauseMenu, SettingsMenu]&quot; as t2&#10;        state &quot;t3: [InGame, PauseMenu]&quot; as t3&#10;        state &quot;t4: [InGame]&quot; as t4&#10;&#10;        t0 --&gt; t1: Push(PauseMenu)&#10;        t1 --&gt; t2: Push(SettingsMenu)&#10;        t2 --&gt; t3: Pop&#10;        t3 --&gt; t4: Pop&#10;    }\">stateDiagram-v2\n    state \"状态栈(时间顺序)\" as stack {\n        state \"t0: [InGame]\" as t0\n        state \"t1: [InGame, PauseMenu]\" as t1\n        state \"t2: [InGame, PauseMenu, SettingsMenu]\" as t2\n        state \"t3: [InGame, PauseMenu]\" as t3\n        state \"t4: [InGame]\" as t4\n\n        t0 --&gt; t1: Push(PauseMenu)\n        t1 --&gt; t2: Push(SettingsMenu)\n        t2 --&gt; t3: Pop\n        t3 --&gt; t4: Pop\n    }</pre><h2 id=\"状态栈实现\">状态栈实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public abstract class StackableState&#10;{&#10;    protected StateStackManager manager;&#10;&#10;    public StackableState(StateStackManager manager)&#10;    {&#10;        this.manager = manager;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 首次进入（Push 时调用）&#10;    public virtual void OnPush() { }&#10;    // 从上层状态返回时调用（Pop 之后恢复）&#10;    public virtual void OnResume() { }&#10;    // 被上层状态覆盖时调用（Push 之前的暂停）&#10;    public virtual void OnSuspend() { }&#10;    // 从栈中移除时调用（Pop 时调用）&#10;    public virtual void OnPop() { }&#10;    // 每帧 Update（只有栈顶状态被 tick）&#10;    public virtual void OnUpdate() { }&#10;}&#10;&#10;public class StateStackManager : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    private Stack&lt;StackableState&gt; stateStack = new Stack&lt;StackableState&gt;();&#10;&#10;    public StackableState CurrentState&#10;        =&gt; stateStack.Count &gt; 0 ? stateStack.Peek() : null;&#10;&#10;    // 将新状态压入栈顶&#10;    public void Push(StackableState newState)&#10;    {&#10;        // 通知当前状态被暂停&#10;        CurrentState?.OnSuspend();&#10;&#10;        stateStack.Push(newState);&#10;        newState.OnPush();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 弹出栈顶状态，恢复上一个状态&#10;    public void Pop()&#10;    {&#10;        if (stateStack.Count == 0) return;&#10;&#10;        var poppedState = stateStack.Pop();&#10;        poppedState.OnPop();&#10;&#10;        // 恢复新的栈顶状态&#10;        CurrentState?.OnResume();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 替换栈顶（等同于 Pop + Push，但保留 Pop 的 OnPop）&#10;    public void Replace(StackableState newState)&#10;    {&#10;        if (stateStack.Count &gt; 0)&#10;        {&#10;            var old = stateStack.Pop();&#10;            old.OnPop();&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        stateStack.Push(newState);&#10;        newState.OnPush();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void Update()&#10;    {&#10;        CurrentState?.OnUpdate();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 调试：查看完整栈&#10;    public IEnumerable&lt;StackableState&gt; GetStack()&#10;        =&gt; stateStack.ToArray();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public abstract class StackableState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    protected StateStackManager manager;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public StackableState(StateStackManager manager)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        this.manager = manager;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 首次进入（Push 时调用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public virtual void OnPush() { }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 从上层状态返回时调用（Pop 之后恢复）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public virtual void OnResume() { }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 被上层状态覆盖时调用（Push 之前的暂停）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public virtual void OnSuspend() { }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 从栈中移除时调用（Pop 时调用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public virtual void OnPop() { }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 每帧 Update（只有栈顶状态被 tick）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public virtual void OnUpdate() { }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class StateStackManager : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Stack&#x3C;StackableState> stateStack = new Stack&#x3C;StackableState>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public StackableState CurrentState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        => stateStack.Count > 0 ? stateStack.Peek() : null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 将新状态压入栈顶</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Push(StackableState newState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 通知当前状态被暂停</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        CurrentState?.OnSuspend();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        stateStack.Push(newState);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        newState.OnPush();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 弹出栈顶状态，恢复上一个状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Pop()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (stateStack.Count == 0) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var poppedState = stateStack.Pop();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        poppedState.OnPop();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 恢复新的栈顶状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        CurrentState?.OnResume();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 替换栈顶（等同于 Pop + Push，但保留 Pop 的 OnPop）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Replace(StackableState newState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (stateStack.Count > 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            var old = stateStack.Pop();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            old.OnPop();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        stateStack.Push(newState);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        newState.OnPush();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Update()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        CurrentState?.OnUpdate();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 调试：查看完整栈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public IEnumerable&#x3C;StackableState> GetStack()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        => stateStack.ToArray();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"菜单层叠场景\">菜单层叠场景</h2><p>典型的多层菜单系统：暂停菜单 → 设置菜单 → 确认弹窗。每个菜单的退出都回到上一层：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class InGameState : StackableState&#10;{&#10;    public InGameState(StateStackManager manager) : base(manager) { }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnPush()&#10;    {&#10;        GameWorld.Instance.Resume();&#10;        InputHandler.Instance.EnableGameplayInput();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnSuspend()&#10;    {&#10;        // 被菜单覆盖时，暂停游戏逻辑但不销毁&#10;        GameWorld.Instance.Pause();&#10;        InputHandler.Instance.DisableGameplayInput();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnResume()&#10;    {&#10;        // 菜单关闭后恢复&#10;        GameWorld.Instance.Resume();&#10;        InputHandler.Instance.EnableGameplayInput();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnUpdate()&#10;    {&#10;        if (Input.GetButtonDown(&quot;Pause&quot;))&#10;            manager.Push(new PauseMenuState(manager));&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;public class PauseMenuState : StackableState&#10;{&#10;    public PauseMenuState(StateStackManager manager) : base(manager) { }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnPush()&#10;    {&#10;        Time.timeScale = 0f;&#10;        UIManager.Instance.ShowPauseMenu();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnPop()&#10;    {&#10;        Time.timeScale = 1f;&#10;        UIManager.Instance.HidePauseMenu();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnUpdate()&#10;    {&#10;        if (Input.GetButtonDown(&quot;Pause&quot;))&#10;            manager.Pop(); // 返回 InGame&#10;&#10;        if (settingsButtonClicked)&#10;            manager.Push(new SettingsMenuState(manager)); // 进入设置&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;public class SettingsMenuState : StackableState&#10;{&#10;    public SettingsMenuState(StateStackManager manager) : base(manager) { }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnPush() =&gt; UIManager.Instance.ShowSettings();&#10;    public override void OnPop() =&gt; UIManager.Instance.HideSettings();&#10;&#10;    public override void OnUpdate()&#10;    {&#10;        if (backButtonClicked)&#10;            manager.Pop(); // 返回 PauseMenu&#10;&#10;        if (confirmResetClicked)&#10;            manager.Push(new ConfirmDialogState(manager, OnConfirmReset));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnConfirmReset()&#10;    {&#10;        // 用户确认重置设置&#10;        SettingsManager.Instance.ResetToDefaults();&#10;        manager.Pop(); // 关闭确认弹窗&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class InGameState : StackableState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public InGameState(StateStackManager manager) : base(manager) { }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnPush()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GameWorld.Instance.Resume();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        InputHandler.Instance.EnableGameplayInput();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnSuspend()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 被菜单覆盖时，暂停游戏逻辑但不销毁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GameWorld.Instance.Pause();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        InputHandler.Instance.DisableGameplayInput();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnResume()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 菜单关闭后恢复</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GameWorld.Instance.Resume();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        InputHandler.Instance.EnableGameplayInput();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnUpdate()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (Input.GetButtonDown(\"Pause\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            manager.Push(new PauseMenuState(manager));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class PauseMenuState : StackableState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public PauseMenuState(StateStackManager manager) : base(manager) { }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnPush()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Time.timeScale = 0f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        UIManager.Instance.ShowPauseMenu();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnPop()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Time.timeScale = 1f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        UIManager.Instance.HidePauseMenu();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnUpdate()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (Input.GetButtonDown(\"Pause\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            manager.Pop(); // 返回 InGame</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (settingsButtonClicked)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            manager.Push(new SettingsMenuState(manager)); // 进入设置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class SettingsMenuState : StackableState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public SettingsMenuState(StateStackManager manager) : base(manager) { }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnPush() => UIManager.Instance.ShowSettings();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnPop() => UIManager.Instance.HideSettings();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnUpdate()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (backButtonClicked)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            manager.Pop(); // 返回 PauseMenu</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (confirmResetClicked)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            manager.Push(new ConfirmDialogState(manager, OnConfirmReset));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnConfirmReset()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 用户确认重置设置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        SettingsManager.Instance.ResetToDefaults();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        manager.Pop(); // 关闭确认弹窗</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"对话系统中的状态栈\">对话系统中的状态栈</h2><p>对话系统是下推自动机的另一个经典应用：NPC 正在巡逻，玩家触发对话，对话结束后 NPC 继续原来的巡逻：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class NPCPatrolState : StackableState&#10;{&#10;    private int waypointIndex = 0;&#10;&#10;    public NPCPatrolState(StateStackManager manager) : base(manager) { }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnPush()&#10;    {&#10;        StartMovingToWaypoint();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnResume()&#10;    {&#10;        // 对话结束后，不重置 waypointIndex，继续从上次位置巡逻&#10;        StartMovingToWaypoint();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnSuspend()&#10;    {&#10;        StopMoving();&#10;        // waypointIndex 被保留在此状态实例中&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private bool playerInTriggerRange;&#10;&#10;    public override void OnUpdate()&#10;    {&#10;        MoveToCurrentWaypoint();&#10;&#10;        if (playerInTriggerRange &amp;&amp; Input.GetButtonDown(&quot;Interact&quot;))&#10;        {&#10;            manager.Push(new NPCDialogueState(manager, this.npcData));&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class NPCPatrolState : StackableState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private int waypointIndex = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public NPCPatrolState(StateStackManager manager) : base(manager) { }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnPush()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        StartMovingToWaypoint();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnResume()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 对话结束后，不重置 waypointIndex，继续从上次位置巡逻</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        StartMovingToWaypoint();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnSuspend()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        StopMoving();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // waypointIndex 被保留在此状态实例中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private bool playerInTriggerRange;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnUpdate()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        MoveToCurrentWaypoint();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (playerInTriggerRange &#x26;&#x26; Input.GetButtonDown(\"Interact\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            manager.Push(new NPCDialogueState(manager, this.npcData));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"状态栈-vs-历史状态\">状态栈 vs 历史状态</h2><p>PDA 状态栈与 HFSM 历史状态机制在概念上相似，但用途不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>状态栈（PDA）</th>\n<th>HFSM 历史状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存储结构</td>\n<td>显式栈，可多层</td>\n<td>每个超状态一个历史记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用场景</td>\n<td>任意层级的「暂停-恢复」</td>\n<td>特定超状态内的「上次记忆」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态可见性</td>\n<td>所有入栈状态实例保留</td>\n<td>只记录上次子状态的标识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层数限制</td>\n<td>理论上无限（实践上 3-5 层）</td>\n<td>每层 1 个历史记录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>下推自动机通过栈结构赋予状态机「暂停与恢复」的能力，完美解决了 FSM 中「A → B → 回 A」时需要手动记住 A 状态的问题。在游戏中，菜单层叠和可打断的 NPC 行为是最典型的应用场景。实现时注意 OnSuspend/OnResume 与 OnPop/OnPush 的语义区分：前者对应暂停/恢复，后者对应真正的离开/进入。</p>\n<p><strong>同章节其他内容</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"concurrent-state-machines\">并发状态机</a> — 同时处理多个独立状态维度的解决方案</li>\n<li><a href=\"data-driven-state-config\">数据驱动状态配置</a> — 状态栈的状态集合可由 JSON 配置动态加载</li>\n<li><a href=\"../game-applications/game-flow-management\">游戏流程管理</a> — 游戏流程中多层菜单覆盖是状态栈的直接应用</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"下推自动机与状态栈","id":"下推自动机与状态栈"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"状态栈实现","id":"状态栈实现"},{"level":2,"text":"菜单层叠场景","id":"菜单层叠场景"},{"level":2,"text":"对话系统中的状态栈","id":"对话系统中的状态栈"},{"level":2,"text":"状态栈 vs 历史状态","id":"状态栈-vs-历史状态"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"游戏流程管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/game-applications/game-flow-management"},"next":{"title":"并发状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/advanced/concurrent-state-machines"}}